{
  "name": "Do...While Test - Poll Until Done",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-400, 0],
      "id": "465a519c-d663-47a7-ac0f-f31fb8ac5fa5",
      "name": "When clicking 'Execute workflow'"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "init-001",
              "name": "counter",
              "value": 0,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "init-002",
              "name": "status",
              "value": "pending",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-160, 0],
      "id": "init-node-001",
      "name": "Initialise"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "condition": "={{ $json.status === 'done' }}",
        "maxIterations": 10,
        "waitSeconds": 0,
        "maxBehavior": "exit"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-do-while.doWhile",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [80, 0],
      "id": "8b0943a5-5307-4c38-9d05-0ffadfa9b37a",
      "name": "Do...While"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const item = $input.first().json;\nconst counter = (item.counter || 0) + 1;\n\n// Simulates a job that completes after 3 checks\nconst status = counter >= 3 ? 'done' : 'pending';\n\nconsole.log(`Check #${counter}: status = ${status}`);\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    counter,\n    status,\n    message: status === 'done'\n      ? 'Job completed!'\n      : `Still processing... (check ${counter} of 3)`\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [80, 240],
      "id": "code-node-001",
      "name": "Simulate Job"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "result-001",
              "name": "result",
              "value": "={{ $json._loop.timedOut ? 'Timed out after ' + $json._loop.iteration + ' checks' : 'Done after ' + ($json._loop.iteration + 1) + ' checks' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "result-002",
              "name": "timedOut",
              "value": "={{ $json._loop.timedOut }}",
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "id": "result-003",
              "name": "totalChecks",
              "value": "={{ $json._loop.iteration + 1 }}",
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [340, 0],
      "id": "result-node-001",
      "name": "Done"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Do...While Test Workflow\n\nThis simulates a job that completes after 3 checks.\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Initialise sets counter = 0, status = pending\n2. Do...While checks if status === done\n3. If not done, Simulate Job increments counter\n4. After 3 checks, status flips to done\n5. Do...While exits via Condition Met pin\n6. Done outputs how many checks it took\n\n**Expected output:**\n- result: Done after 3 checks\n- timedOut: false\n- totalChecks: 3",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-400, -320],
      "id": "sticky-001",
      "name": "How This Works"
    }
  ],
